  /**
   * Retrieve the cancellation request snapshot history for a customer-owned order item.
   *
   * This test validates the read-only snapshot-history contract for cancellation requests.
   * It focuses on the endpoint's pagination response shape and on the immutability of
   * the returned history across repeated reads.
